"q": "A customer support organization has 4 million archived support tickets stored as text files in Amazon S3. For each ticket it wants a two-sentence summary and a category from a company-specific taxonomy of 25 categories that is described in natural language. There is no latency requirement; the results will be loaded into Amazon Redshift over the next week. The company has no labeled training data.\n\nWhich solution is the MOST cost-effective?",
