"q": "A company's Amazon Redshift data warehouse holds historical sales. Current inventory lives in an Amazon Aurora PostgreSQL database and changes every few seconds. Analysts need to join live inventory levels with warehouse sales in a single Redshift query, without building a pipeline or copying inventory data into Redshift.\n\nWhich solution meets these requirements?",
