"q": "A company runs 30 nightly AWS Glue 5.0 Spark jobs on G.1X workers. The jobs start at 11 PM and must finish before 7 AM, and they usually take less than 2 hours. Input volume can vary by a factor of 10 from one night to the next, and each job has a fixed 40 workers, so executors sit idle on light nights.\n\nWhich combination of changes will reduce cost with the LEAST effort? (Select TWO.)",
