"Resize the cluster by adding nodes so that all 5 years fit in managed storage.",
"`UNLOAD` rows older than 2 years to Amazon S3 as Parquet partitioned by year and month, and then delete them from the table.",
"Define an external table in the Data Catalog over the unloaded files, and query it through Amazon Redshift Spectrum, for example in a late-binding view with `UNION ALL`.",
