"q": "An AWS Lambda function enriches incoming records by looking up values in a 6 GB reference dataset. A separate process updates the dataset every hour, and every concurrent invocation must see the latest version. Downloading the file from Amazon S3 in each new execution environment adds too much latency. Which solution meets these requirements?",
