"q": "A company stores application logs in an Amazon OpenSearch Service domain with one index per day. Logs are searched heavily for the first 7 days. After that they are only searched occasionally and can be read-only, and they must be deleted after 90 days. The domain already has dedicated master nodes and UltraWarm nodes. The company wants the MOST cost-effective solution, with no manual steps. What should the data engineer do?",
