"A resource-based policy on each secret and each job that lists the IAM roles allowed to use it, updated as teams are added.",
"A permissions boundary for each engineer that lists the ARNs of the resources that belong to the engineer's current project.",
"A policy that allows actions only when `aws:ResourceTag/project` matches `${aws:PrincipalTag/project}`, and denies changes to the `project` tag."
