"q": "A manufacturing company runs one Amazon SageMaker Unified Studio domain for its Finance, Marketing, and Supply Chain business units. Today only the two domain administrators can decide who creates projects, and they have become a bottleneck. Each business unit's data lead must be able to decide which users and groups can create projects in that business unit. The leads must not get administrative control over the domain or over the other business units.\n\nWhich solution will meet these requirements?",
