"q": "A company runs one Amazon Bedrock knowledge base over documents from its HR, Finance, and Legal departments, stored under separate prefixes in one S3 bucket. An internal application builds its own prompt template and calls its own choice of model, so it needs only the retrieved chunks and their sources. Each user's searches must return chunks only from that user's department.\n\nWhich solution will meet these requirements with the LEAST operational overhead?",
