"q": "A retailer's finance team reports that a revenue column in an Amazon Redshift reporting table looks wrong. A data engineer must trace the column back through the AWS Glue ETL jobs and the Redshift transformations that produce it to the original source tables. Some of the upstream jobs are orchestrated by Apache Airflow in Amazon MWAA. The engineer also needs to see which downstream assets would be affected by a fix.\n\nWhich solution will meet these requirements?",
