"q": "A custom RAG pipeline stores Amazon Titan Text Embeddings V2 vectors at the default 1,024 dimensions in an Amazon Aurora PostgreSQL `vector(1024)` column with an HNSW index. To cut storage and memory, the team will configure Titan Text Embeddings V2 to output 256-dimension vectors from now on. The existing corpus has 20 million chunks.\n\nWhich TWO actions are required for similarity search to keep returning correct results? (Select TWO.)",
