"Re-embed all existing chunks at 256 dimensions, and rebuild the column as `vector(256)` with a new HNSW index.",
"Generate query embeddings with the same model and the same 256-dimension setting that were used for the stored vectors.",
"Switch queries from cosine distance (`<=>`) to L2 distance (`<->`), because 256-dimension Titan V2 vectors aren't normalized.",
"Rebuild the HNSW index with `m` reduced from 16 to 4 so that the graph degree matches the smaller number of dimensions."
